{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41868","headline":"思九江旧居三首 二 · 李中","name":"思九江旧居三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门前烟水似潇湘，放旷优游兴味长。\n虚阁静眠听远浪，扁舟闲上泛残阳。\n鹤翘碧藓庭除冷，竹引清风枕簟凉。\n犬吠疎篱明月上，隣翁携酒到茅堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}